        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 510/300  Long Contemporary Aluminum Rectangular Flush Pull </b>\r\n<p>\r\nLonger, Sleeker  and more Modern  looking than the very popular Shorter 510/200  <a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-rectangular-flush-pull-first-impressions-fii-510-200-us15\"><b>Contemporary Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a>. <b>Limited Supply!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis long contemporary design flush pull is available in your choice of  Polished Chrome or Satin Nickel. Large contemporary rectangular flush pull for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a \"Flush with the door face\" pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConcealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions FII-510/300 Large Contemporary Flush Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 11-13/16\" (300 MM)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\" (57 MM)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/8\" Thick Non-Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>**** This item is discontinued</b>. Please use <a href=\"/products/11-13-16-inch-long-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>DWD-718/300 Contemporary Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
